WEBVTT

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:31.416
but let me just focus on five today.

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:34.336
The first is: look up.

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:36.376
I started my trail of gratitude

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:39.696
by thanking the barista
at my local coffee shop,

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:41.376
Joe Coffee in New York.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.096
Her name is Chung,

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:47.856
and Chung is one of the most
upbeat people you will ever meet.

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:51.216
Big smiler, enthusiastic hugger.

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:54.736
But even for Chung,
being a barista is hard.

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:59.656
And that's because you are encountering
people in a very dangerous state.

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:00.936
(Laughter)